<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Parke-Davis net 24.3 pct up.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Parke-Davis net 24.3 pct up.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended November 30 (million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		     792 vs 698</p>
<p>    Profit before tax     206 vs 186</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	153 vs 123</p>
<p>    Interim div paid   90 pct vs  80 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>    Final dividend     90 pct vs  80 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Parke-Davis &amp; Company Ltd is a pharmaceutical company. It transferred 118 million rupees vs 92 million to general reserve. Book closure May 20-27. AGM on May 27.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
